{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，衞北宮結率師侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"二、夏，公會尹子、單子、晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、邾婁人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"三、六月乙酉，同盟于柯陵。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"四、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"五、齊高無咎出奔莒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"六、九月辛丑用郊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"用者何？用者不宜用也。九月非所用郊也。然則郊曷用？郊用正月上辛，或曰用然後郊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"七、晉侯使荀罃來乞師。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"八、冬，公會單子、晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、齊人、邾婁人伐鄭。十有一月，公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"九、壬申，公孫嬰齊卒于貍軫。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"非此月日也，曷為以此月日卒之？待君命然後卒大夫。曷為待君命然後卒大夫？前此者嬰齊走之晉，公會晉侯，將執公。嬰齊為公請，公許之，反為大夫，歸至于貍軫而卒。無君命不敢卒大夫，公至，曰：「吾固許之，反為大夫。」然後卒之。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"十、十有二月丁巳朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"十一、邾婁子貜且卒。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"十二、晉殺其大夫郤錡、郤州、郤至。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_149_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_149","textTraditional":"十三、楚人滅舒庸。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}